    disclosureResponseTitle: '3 dias úteis para confirmar',
    disclosureResponseBody:
      'Confirmaremos o recebimento de um relatório em até <strong>3 dias úteis</strong> e forneceremos uma avaliação inicial em até <strong>10 dias úteis</strong>. Prazos de correção orientados pela severidade seguem a partir daí, e manteremos você informado.',
    disclosureSafeLabel: '// porto seguro',
    disclosureSafeP1:
      'Não tomaremos medidas legais contra pesquisadores que, de boa-fé, sigam esta política: evitem violações de privacidade, destruição de dados e degradação do serviço; interajam apenas com contas próprias ou com permissão explícita para testar; nos deem tempo razoável para corrigir antes da divulgação pública; e não explorem nenhuma vulnerabilidade além do necessário para demonstrá-la.',
    disclosureSafeP2:
      'Fora do escopo: negação de serviço, engenharia social contra a equipe, ataques físicos à infraestrutura e descobertas em serviços de terceiros onde a Liv não tem caminho de correção.',

    sectionHLabel: '// seção H · recursos',
    sectionHTitle: 'perguntas frequentes',
    faq: [
      {
        q: 'A Liv tem certificação SOC 2?',
        a: 'Ainda não. O CASA Tier 2 cobre a superfície da aplicação que toca o OAuth, conforme o OWASP ASVS. SOC 2 Type II está no nosso caminho até o GA.',
      },
      {
        q: 'Onde meus dados ficam armazenados?',
        a: 'Na Austrália (Sydney). No momento não oferecemos residência de dados multirregião.',
      },
      {
        q: 'Posso exportar ou excluir meus dados?',
        a: 'Sim. Desconectar o Google revoga os tokens junto ao Google e remove as entradas correspondentes do nosso cofre de segredos. Uma solicitação de exclusão completa de conta para <a href="mailto:support@liv4all.com">support@liv4all.com</a> derruba o registro da sua conta, seu runtime de agente dedicado e todas as credenciais que guardamos para você. Logs operacionais são retidos pelo período documentado na nossa <a href="/privacy">política de privacidade</a>.',
      },
      {
        q: 'Qual modelo a Liv usa?',
        a: 'Claude (o modelo Sonnet GA mais recente da Anthropic). Não treinamos modelos com seus dados; os termos enterprise da Anthropic se aplicam.',
      },
      {
        q: 'O widget de embed vê os dados do meu painel?',
        a: 'Não. O widget público roda contra um serviço de base de conhecimento separado e isolado, sem nenhum acesso a dados de operadores.',
      },
      {
        q: 'Com que frequência a Letter of Validation é renovada?',
        a: 'Anualmente. Deixamos um lembrete no calendário dez meses antes para que a reavaliação já esteja em andamento quando a LoV atual expirar.',
      },
    ],

    bottomUpdated: 'Última atualização',
    bottomLov: 'Solicitar a Letter of Validation',
    bottomSecurity: 'Política de segurança',
    bottomSecurityTxt: 'security.txt',
  },
}[lang];

const securityHref = localizePath('/security', lang);
---
<BaseLayout
  title={copy.metaTitle}
  description={copy.metaDescription}
  ogUrl={canonicalUrl('/trust', lang)}
  canonical={canonicalUrl('/trust', lang)}
  lang={lang}
>
  <div class="trust-page">
    <!-- Section A — Hero / Compliance summary -->
    <header class="hero">
      <div class="container-trust">
        <div class="eyebrow fade-in">{copy.eyebrow}</div>

        <h1 class="fade-in fade-in-delay-1" set:html={copy.heroTitle} />

        <p class="hero-sub fade-in fade-in-delay-2">{copy.heroSub}</p>

        <div class="badge-row fade-in fade-in-delay-2">
          <div class="badge-card badge-card-primary">
            <img
              src="/tac-esof-casa-tier2-badge.png"
              alt={copy.badgeImgAlt}
              width="120"
              height="138"
              loading="eager"
            />
            <div class="badge-meta">
              <div class="badge-name">{copy.badge1Name}</div>
              <div class="badge-detail">{copy.badge1Detail}</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="badge-card">
            <div class="badge-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2 4 6v6c0 5 3.5 9 8 10 4.5-1 8-5 8-10V6l-8-4Z"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="badge-meta">
              <div class="badge-name">{copy.badge2Name}</div>
              <div class="badge-detail">{copy.badge2Detail}</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="badge-card">
            <div class="badge-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M3.5 12h17M12 3.5c2.5 2.7 4 6 4 8.5s-1.5 5.8-4 8.5C9.5 17.8 8 14.5 8 12s1.5-5.8 4-8.5Z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="badge-meta">
              <div class="badge-name">{copy.badge3Name}</div>
              <div class="badge-detail">{copy.badge3Detail}</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="badge-caption fade-in fade-in-delay-3" set:html={copy.badgeCaption} />

        <div class="hero-coverage fade-in fade-in-delay-3">
          <div class="hero-coverage-label">{copy.coverageLabel}</div>
          <ul>
            {copy.coverageItems.map((item) => (
              <li set:html={item} />
            ))}
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-ctas fade-in fade-in-delay-4">
          <a href={lovMailto} class="cta cta-primary">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 6h16v12H4z"/><path d="m4 7 8 6 8-6"/></svg>
            {copy.ctaPrimary}
          </a>
          <a href={securityHref} class="cta cta-secondary">{copy.ctaSecondary}</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Sticky in-page nav -->
    <nav class="trust-nav" aria-label={copy.navAriaLabel}>
      <div class="container-trust trust-nav-inner">
        {copy.navLinks.map((link) => (
          <a href={link.href}>{link.label}</a>
        ))}
      </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- Section B — What CASA Tier 2 actually means -->
    <section id="compliance" class="section">
      <div class="container-trust">
        <div class="section-label fade-in">{copy.sectionBLabel}</div>
        <h2 class="fade-in">{copy.sectionBTitle}</h2>

        <div class="prose fade-in">
          {copy.prose.map((para) => (
            <p set:html={para} />
          ))}
        </div>

        <div class="flow fade-in" aria-label={copy.flowAriaLabel}>
          <div class="flow-label">{copy.flowLabel}</div>
          <div class="flow-row">
            <div class="flow-node">
              <div class="flow-node-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M3 8h18"/></svg>
              </div>
              <div class="flow-node-label">{copy.flowNodes[0]}</div>
            </div>
            <div class="flow-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</div>
            <div class="flow-node">
              <div class="flow-node-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2v6m0 8v6M2 12h6m8 0h6M5 5l4 4m6 6 4 4M5 19l4-4m6-6 4-4"/></svg>
              </div>
              <div class="flow-node-label">{copy.flowNodes[1]}</div>
            </div>
            <div class="flow-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</div>
            <div class="flow-node">
              <div class="flow-node-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><path d="M3 9h18M9 21V9"/></svg>
              </div>
              <div class="flow-node-label">{copy.flowNodes[2]}</div>
            </div>
            <div class="flow-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</div>
            <div class="flow-node flow-node-emphasis">
              <div class="flow-node-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="4" y="10" width="16" height="11" rx="2"/><path d="M8 10V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3"/></svg>
              </div>
              <div class="flow-node-label">{copy.flowNodes[3]}</div>
            </div>
            <div class="flow-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</div>
            <div class="flow-node">
              <div class="flow-node-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M3.5 12h17M12 3.5c2.5 2.7 4 6 4 8.5s-1.5 5.8-4 8.5C9.5 17.8 8 14.5 8 12s1.5-5.8 4-8.5Z"/></svg>
              </div>
              <div class="flow-node-label">{copy.flowNodes[4]}</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="flow-caption">{copy.flowCaption}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Section C — How we handle your data -->
    <section id="data" class="section section-alt">
      <div class="container-trust">
        <div class="section-label fade-in">{copy.sectionCLabel}</div>
        <h2 class="fade-in">{copy.sectionCTitle}</h2>
        <p class="section-sub fade-in">{copy.sectionCSub}</p>

        <div class="card-grid fade-in">
          {copy.dataCards.map((card) => (
            <article class="data-card">
              <div class="data-card-id">{card.id.toUpperCase()}</div>
              <h3>{card.headline}</h3>
              <p>{card.body}</p>
            </article>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Section D — Architecture & isolation -->
    <section id="architecture" class="section">
      <div class="container-trust">
        <div class="section-label fade-in">{copy.sectionDLabel}</div>
        <h2 class="fade-in">{copy.sectionDTitle}</h2>
        <p class="section-sub fade-in">{copy.sectionDSub}</p>

        {copy.panels.map((panel) => (
          <div class="panel fade-in">
            <div class="panel-tag">{panel.tag}</div>
            <h3>{panel.title}</h3>
            <ul class="panel-list">
              {panel.items.map((item) => (
                <li set:html={item} />
              ))}
            </ul>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Section E — AI-specific safety -->
    <section id="ai-safety" class="section section-alt">
      <div class="container-trust">
        <div class="section-label fade-in">{copy.sectionELabel}</div>
        <h2 class="fade-in">{copy.sectionETitle}</h2>
        <p class="section-sub fade-in">{copy.sectionESub}</p>

        <div class="ai-grid">
          {copy.aiCards.map((card) => (
            <article class="ai-card fade-in">
              <div class="ai-card-tag">{card.tag}</div>
              <p>{card.body}</p>
            </article>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Section F — Sub-processors -->
    <section id="sub-processors" class="section">
      <div class="container-trust">
        <div class="section-label fade-in">{copy.sectionFLabel}</div>
        <h2 class="fade-in">{copy.sectionFTitle}</h2>
        <p class="section-sub fade-in">{copy.sectionFSub}</p>

        <div class="table-wrap fade-in">
          <table class="trust-table">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                {copy.tableHeaders.map((header) => (
                  <th>{header}</th>
                ))}
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              {copy.subprocessors.map((row) => (
                <tr>
                  <td><strong>{row.name}</strong></td>
                  <td>{row.purpose}</td>
                  <td>{row.region}</td>
                  <td>{row.data}</td>
                </tr>
              ))}
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>

        <div class="commitment fade-in">
          <div class="commitment-label">{copy.commitmentLabel}</div>
          <p set:html={copy.commitmentBody} />
        </div>

        <p class="section-aside fade-in" set:html={copy.privacyAside} />
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Section G — Disclosure -->
    <section id="disclosure" class="section section-alt">
      <div class="container-trust">
        <div class="section-label fade-in">{copy.sectionGLabel}</div>
        <h2 class="fade-in">{copy.sectionGTitle}</h2>
        <p class="section-sub fade-in">{copy.sectionGSub}</p>

        <div class="disclosure-grid">
          <div class="disclosure-card fade-in">
            <div class="disclosure-card-label">{copy.disclosureContactLabel}</div>
            <h3>{copy.disclosureContactTitle}</h3>
            <p set:html={copy.disclosureContactBody} />
          </div>

          <div class="disclosure-card fade-in">
            <div class="disclosure-card-label">{copy.disclosureResponseLabel}</div>
            <h3>{copy.disclosureResponseTitle}</h3>
            <p set:html={copy.disclosureResponseBody} />
          </div>

          <div class="disclosure-card disclosure-card-wide fade-in">
            <div class="disclosure-card-label">{copy.disclosureSafeLabel}</div>
            <p set:html={copy.disclosureSafeP1} />
            <p set:html={copy.disclosureSafeP2} />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Section H — FAQ / Resources -->
    <section id="faq" class="section">
      <div class="container-trust">
        <div class="section-label fade-in">{copy.sectionHLabel}</div>
        <h2 class="fade-in">{copy.sectionHTitle}</h2>

        <div class="trust-faq fade-in">
          {copy.faq.map((item) => (
            <details>
              <summary>{item.q}</summary>
              <p set:html={item.a} />
            </details>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Section I — Page footer -->
    <div class="trust-bottom">
      <div class="container-trust trust-bottom-inner">
        <span>{copy.bottomUpdated} <time datetime={lastUpdated}>{lastUpdated}</time></span>
        <span class="trust-bottom-sep" aria-hidden="true">·</span>
        <a href={lovMailto}>{copy.bottomLov}</a>
        <span class="trust-bottom-sep" aria-hidden="true">·</span>
        <a href={securityHref}>{copy.bottomSecurity}</a>
        <span class="trust-bottom-sep" aria-hidden="true">·</span>
        <a href="/.well-known/security.txt">{copy.bottomSecurityTxt}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .trust-page { padding-top: 80px; }

  .container-trust {
    width: min(1100px, 100%);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 24px;
  }

  /* ── Hero ── */
  .hero {
    padding: 56px 0 40px;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 6px 14px;
    background: var(--accent-glow);
    border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15);
    border-radius: 100px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.4rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .hero-sub {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    max-width: 640px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  /* ── Badge row ── */
  .badge-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .badge-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }

  .badge-card {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 20px 22px;
    background: var(--surface-glass);
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    transition: border-color 0.3s, transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
  }

  .badge-card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
  }

  .badge-card-primary {
    border-color: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25);
    background: linear-gradient(140deg, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08), rgba(18, 18, 26, 0.6));
  }

  .badge-card img {
    display: block;
    width: 56px;
    height: auto;
    object-fit: contain;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .badge-icon {
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--accent);
    background: var(--accent-glow);
    border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.2);
    border-radius: 12px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .badge-icon svg { width: 22px; height: 22px; }

  .badge-meta { min-width: 0; }
  .badge-name {
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 2px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .badge-detail {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }

  .badge-caption {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    max-width: 720px;
    margin-bottom: 36px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .badge-caption :global(strong) { color: var(--text); font-weight: 500; }

  /* ── Hero coverage ── */
  .hero-coverage {
    background: var(--surface-glass);
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 24px 26px;
    margin-bottom: 36px;
  }

  .hero-coverage-label {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .hero-coverage ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .hero-coverage li {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    padding-left: 22px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .hero-coverage li::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0.6em;
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius: 50%;
    box-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--accent-glow);
  }

  .hero-coverage :global(code) {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.85em;
    color: var(--text);
    background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.1);
    padding: 2px 6px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
  }

  /* ── CTAs ── */
  .hero-ctas {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .cta {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    padding: 14px 22px;
    border-radius: 100px;
    transition: all 0.25s;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
  }

  .cta svg { width: 16px; height: 16px; }

  .cta-primary {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #fff !important;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25);
  }
  .cta-primary:hover {
    background: #7c3aed;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.45);
    text-decoration: none !important;
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  .cta-secondary {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--text);
    border-color: var(--border-light);
  }
  .cta-secondary:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: none !important;
  }

  /* ── Sticky in-page nav ── */
  .trust-nav {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 50;
    background: rgba(10, 10, 15, 0.85);
    backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    margin-top: 32px;
  }

  .trust-nav-inner {
    display: flex;
    gap: 28px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    padding-top: 14px;
    padding-bottom: 14px;
    scrollbar-width: none;
  }

  .trust-nav-inner::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }

  .trust-nav a {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    white-space: nowrap;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .trust-nav a:hover { color: var(--text); text-decoration: none; }

  /* ── Sections ── */
  .section { padding: 72px 0; }
  .section-alt { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.015); border-top: 1px solid var(--border-light); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light); }

  .section-label {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 6px 14px;
    background: var(--accent-glow);
    border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15);
    border-radius: 100px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 1.9rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .section-sub {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    max-width: 700px;
    margin-bottom: 36px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .section-aside {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    margin-top: 24px;
  }

  /* ── Prose ── */
  .prose { max-width: 760px; margin-bottom: 48px; }
  .prose p { font-size: 0.98rem; color: var(--text-dim); line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .prose :global(strong) { color: var(--text); font-weight: 500; }
  .prose :global(a) { color: var(--accent); }

  /* ── Flow diagram ── */
  .flow {
